    "message": "0515 ablation: env-var gates for qV + sign-fix + register 0514 chain models\n\nAdds two env-var overrides for the 0515 (head ON/OFF) × (qV+sign-fix vs\npre-0428 ORIGINAL) 2x2 ablation, both gated off by default so production\nbehavior is unchanged:\n- FORCE_DISABLE_QV=1 in PolarMACE.forward → falls back to legacy qER even\n  when batch has external_potential\n- FORCE_NO_NEGATE=1 in AtomicData.from_config → keeps E_input = +E_phys\n  (pre-0428 OMol25 convention)\n\nAlso registers the four 0514 qV chain candidates (ft1_lr5e4 + ft2_lr{1,2,5}e4_q10)\nin eval_macepol_0428.py MODELS so the val_f sweep can target them by tag.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
